f timing is needed."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"TYPOGRAPHY","timestamp_seconds":10.5,"problem":"The CTA text is too large and heavy for the shot, crowding the lower-left corner and feeling more like a caption dump than a polished offer lockup.","fix":"Shrink the CTA copy, give it more breathing room, and use a cleaner two-line stack with better safe-area margins."},{"severity":"LOW","category":"BRAND","timestamp_seconds":10.5,"problem":"Brand naming appears only at the end and is not visually integrated throughout the reel.","fix":"Keep the ending brand lockup, but consider a lighter early brand cue or logo treatment if available in the same shot set."}]
